    "finding": "The required compact-C2 entropy/mass/derivative-square convergence needs no new CLT or unbounded-integral theorem. Actual35 output plus three true BCFs and integral-map domain transfer suffices. Use root ofCompactSupport to avoid porting SLT bespoke boundedness/BCF constructors. Zero entropy mass is admitted through continuous tlogt.",
    "smallest_next_target": "One genuine actual count-law integration node producing three observer L1 domains on gaussianReal0,1 and every actual finite count law, three observer integral limits and their actual entropy limit, with only f: R->R, ContDiff R 2 f and HasCompactSupport f as public analytic binders. Obtain actual law sequence by calling35 internally; no supplied law/limit/normalizer/L1/entropy certificate.",
    "dependency_ready_condition": "35 publicly sealed interface is sufficient, but its exact admitted compiled state is deliberately not certified or inferred by this preread. Mathematical implementation of36 waits35 independent admission."
  },
